⚡🇮🇩🇺🇸 Separatist rebels in Indonesia’s Papua region shot dead an American pilot and set his civilian aircraft on fire after it landed in Yahukimo, according to Reuters.

The West Papua National Liberation Army claimed responsibility, saying the attack was a message to the U.S. and Indonesian governments.

