⚡🇮🇳🇯🇵 Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi announced that India and Japan have agreed to their first-ever joint defense development project.

The two countries will co-develop the UNICORN naval radio antenna system, with Modi saying the project will mark a new chapter in bilateral defense cooperation and strengthen regional peace, maritime security, and the rules-based order.

